WEBVTT

00:06.360 --> 00:08.230
This is so like you, Koyori-chan.

00:08.230 --> 00:11.610
Yeah. I thought you'd be lonely.

00:11.820 --> 00:12.780
Mana-san...

00:12.780 --> 00:16.910
Ah no, I mean, my sister always comes to visit, so...

00:17.620 --> 00:18.740
Besides...

00:19.040 --> 00:21.660
There's someone who always plays with me...

00:22.000 --> 00:23.460
So you made a friend?

00:24.750 --> 00:25.920
A friend?

00:26.210 --> 00:27.340
She isn't?

00:30.380 --> 00:31.420
Not really.

00:33.840 --> 00:35.010
At least...

00:35.260 --> 00:37.050
...I think we're friends.

00:54.270 --> 01:00.690
hane ga shiroku hikari mabushiku tondeyuku

00:54.270 --> 01:00.690
White feathers gleam and fly away brightly

01:01.110 --> 01:07.740
kokoro dake nosete hoshii no ni

01:01.110 --> 01:07.740
Though I only want to set my heart on them

01:08.740 --> 01:15.000
tsumetai te wo nobasu todokanai... shitteru

01:08.740 --> 01:15.000
I extend my cold hands - They won't reach... I know

01:15.630 --> 01:22.720
dakedo ima furetai kimi ni

01:15.630 --> 01:22.720
But I want to touch you now

01:22.880 --> 01:28.850
natsukashii kaze ni ha ano koro no fune

01:22.880 --> 01:28.850
On that nostalgic wind - A ship from the past

01:29.260 --> 01:37.270
maboroshi ga omoide wo miseta

01:29.260 --> 01:37.270
An illusion showed me memories

01:38.340 --> 01:47.280
"wasurenai" dareka no koe ga setsunaku hibiku

01:38.340 --> 01:47.280
"I won't forget" Someone's voice echoes painfully

01:47.450 --> 01:52.370
hajimaru yokan ni furuete

01:47.450 --> 01:52.370
Trembling with a foreboding

01:52.660 --> 02:00.710
"wasuretai" negau jibun ga wakaranai

01:52.660 --> 02:00.710
"I want to forget" I cannot understand myself for hoping so

02:01.090 --> 02:10.430
matteiru yurarenagara yume hitotsu wo

02:01.090 --> 02:10.430
I shall wait while swaying, for that one dream

02:17.010 --> 02:22.480
Two People's Wish

02:31.460 --> 02:32.380
Matsuri.

02:34.210 --> 02:36.010
What do you think of that doll?

02:37.840 --> 02:39.300
It's really cute.

02:39.300 --> 02:40.260
You really think so?

02:40.590 --> 02:42.050
Especially its lips.

02:43.850 --> 02:44.930
Isn't it?

02:46.520 --> 02:47.390
Coming.

02:48.520 --> 02:49.600
Morning, Mana.

02:49.770 --> 02:51.190
Morning, Yorito.

02:52.810 --> 02:54.820
Matsuri-san, good morning.

02:55.020 --> 02:56.320
Good night.

02:57.440 --> 02:58.820
Is she going to bed now?

02:59.030 --> 03:00.740
Well, she's just like that.

03:01.110 --> 03:02.320
I see...

03:03.070 --> 03:04.080
Matsuri-san.

03:05.160 --> 03:07.290
These are mine,

03:07.700 --> 03:09.040
but if you like them...

03:09.710 --> 03:10.540
Really?

03:10.750 --> 03:13.130
Yeah, I thought you might be in trouble,

03:13.460 --> 03:16.380
since Yorito is careless about these things.

03:16.550 --> 03:16.920
I know, I know.

03:16.920 --> 03:17.590
I know, I know.

03:17.760 --> 03:21.550
And when it comes to the things he likes, he's oblivious of his surroundings.

03:21.800 --> 03:23.010
I know, I know!

03:23.760 --> 03:27.680
I'll be happy to help you anytime if you get sick of staying at Yorito's place.

03:29.480 --> 03:31.140
Yes, thank you.

03:35.230 --> 03:38.690
She didn't have to nod and smile like that...

03:58.170 --> 03:58.800
How's this?

04:00.630 --> 04:01.510
How's what?

04:03.010 --> 04:03.630
No good?

04:03.880 --> 04:04.470
No good.

04:05.180 --> 04:06.390
Even if you look at it like this?

04:07.760 --> 04:10.140
Matsuri said it was pretty good though.

04:10.430 --> 04:10.980
No way!

04:11.430 --> 04:12.140
Especially...

04:12.390 --> 04:13.980
These lips.

04:16.520 --> 04:18.150
Those are lips?

04:24.280 --> 04:25.280
Are they off today?

04:25.820 --> 04:27.780
It's a little-known shop, so it's always empty.

04:32.370 --> 04:33.750
A little-known shop, eh?

04:48.640 --> 04:50.640
We don't have much time, you know.

04:51.060 --> 04:52.270
Just a little longer.

04:54.850 --> 04:56.270
What are you going to do about this?

04:56.810 --> 04:58.860
I thought I might as well give it to Matsuri,

04:59.320 --> 05:00.900
since she seems to like it.

05:01.900 --> 05:03.030
Hey, Yorito.

05:03.740 --> 05:06.410
Why don't you stop buying dolls?

05:06.610 --> 05:09.490
It doesn't seem to make Aono-san any happier either.

05:10.080 --> 05:11.410
It doesn't?

05:13.330 --> 05:16.330
But still, until Sis comes back home...

05:17.710 --> 05:19.710
Is Aono-san still...?

05:22.050 --> 05:24.590
It all depends on the results of the checkup, which should come out soon.

05:26.130 --> 05:27.300
I see.

05:27.890 --> 05:29.760
That's why, since I can't be with her,

05:30.260 --> 05:33.310
I have them stay next to Sis in my place.

05:44.820 --> 05:45.650
Sis.

05:45.650 --> 05:46.780
How are you feeling?

05:47.610 --> 05:48.450
Normal.

05:48.860 --> 05:49.700
Good.

05:51.120 --> 05:51.950
Umm...

05:51.950 --> 05:53.080
Where's Koyori?

05:54.160 --> 05:55.790
She didn't come today.

05:55.790 --> 05:56.960
I see.

05:57.330 --> 05:58.540
That's unusual.

05:58.960 --> 06:01.340
Excuse me, I'll go look in her room.

06:05.170 --> 06:05.880
Sis.

06:06.130 --> 06:06.670
Take this.

06:10.180 --> 06:12.300
You could at least tell me what you think...

06:12.720 --> 06:14.430
I might see it in a nightmare.

06:25.150 --> 06:27.990
You're very quiet today.

06:28.900 --> 06:32.450
I'm sorry. You don't have to come here every day.

06:34.120 --> 06:37.790
Why can't you say things like "Wow, my sister's here"?

06:37.790 --> 06:41.380
Or "I love my sister so much"?

06:42.250 --> 06:45.380
But I don't think acting like that suits me.

06:45.710 --> 06:47.420
Well, excuse me then.

06:54.310 --> 06:56.890
So, what's really the matter?

06:57.310 --> 06:58.850
Nothing's wrong.

06:59.270 --> 07:01.310
I'm a good little girl day and nigh-

07:02.520 --> 07:05.980
You haven't talked to Aono-san about being discharged from the hospital?

07:11.070 --> 07:13.160
How about if I tell her instead?

07:14.620 --> 07:16.330
It's okay.

07:17.490 --> 07:19.830
I'll tell her myself.

07:21.830 --> 07:23.210
That'd be better.

07:30.920 --> 07:34.640
You're thinking about Morimiya-kun again.

07:35.600 --> 07:36.310
What?

07:40.430 --> 07:42.100
So you weren't...

07:44.560 --> 07:48.360
Hey, Miss Waitress! It's time to work, time to work!

07:46.570 --> 07:48.940
Hey, the same goes for you, Sae!

07:49.860 --> 07:50.610
Geez...

07:54.450 --> 07:55.370
Welcome.

07:55.740 --> 07:57.240
A non-smoking table, right?

07:57.370 --> 07:59.910
I'd prefer the smoking area, but...

08:00.290 --> 08:04.670
The delicate aroma of the seafood would be ruined in the smoking area.

08:05.250 --> 08:07.630
So that's how it is. A non-smoking table please.

08:07.840 --> 08:08.250
Right.

08:11.470 --> 08:12.420
Mana.

08:14.220 --> 08:15.340
What are you doing?

08:15.590 --> 08:18.100
That customer came here, right?

08:18.430 --> 08:20.350
You mean the man that's been coming here a lot lately?

08:20.520 --> 08:21.310
Yeah, yeah!

08:21.810 --> 08:23.390
Isn't it so nice...?

08:23.390 --> 08:24.140
His beard.

08:24.270 --> 08:24.980
His beard?

08:25.480 --> 08:27.360
You're interested in him too, right?

08:28.020 --> 08:28.860
His beard...

08:28.860 --> 08:29.780
It's real.

08:30.150 --> 08:31.740
But if I had to pick,

08:31.900 --> 08:34.450
that girl gets my attention more.

08:35.570 --> 08:38.620
Thank you for waiting. Here's your beef curry.

08:42.000 --> 08:45.710
So which part of that gives off "the delicate aroma of seafood"?

08:46.040 --> 08:47.130
Shut it.

08:58.300 --> 09:00.180
I've got to find it soon.

09:59.160 --> 09:59.990
Umm...

10:00.910 --> 10:03.080
Sorry for intruding,

10:03.330 --> 10:04.790
but is something the matter?

10:07.040 --> 10:09.460
Is something bothering you?

10:20.180 --> 10:22.930
I'm Ishizuki Koyori.

10:23.350 --> 10:25.720
I'm going to be hospitalized from now on.

10:29.060 --> 10:31.940
I'm supposed to be sleeping now,

10:32.480 --> 10:33.860
but I just can't.

10:33.860 --> 10:36.110
It might be because I'm not used to this place, but I can't fall asleep.

10:42.200 --> 10:44.240
May I know your name?

10:44.490 --> 10:45.910
The wrong one came out.

10:47.540 --> 10:50.750
The wrong one came out when I pressed the button.

10:53.460 --> 10:54.960
Out of order

10:55.300 --> 10:56.800
I don't like coffee.

10:57.920 --> 10:58.920
It's bitter.

11:00.340 --> 11:02.220
That's a problem.

11:04.470 --> 11:06.560
I'll go call somebody.

11:06.560 --> 11:07.390
There's no need.

11:23.200 --> 11:26.870
Can I see your origami?

11:39.510 --> 11:40.260
Umm...

11:40.800 --> 11:45.050
If I get used to it, will I be able to fall asleep in the hospital?

11:45.640 --> 11:49.060
It's not because you're not used to it that you can't sleep.

11:50.140 --> 11:51.520
You're right...

11:52.020 --> 11:53.480
The reason I can't sleep is...

11:54.060 --> 11:55.520
Because I'm lonely.

12:06.160 --> 12:08.290
"I'll tell her myself".

12:13.040 --> 12:14.040
I'm such...

12:14.330 --> 12:15.460
a liar.

12:28.510 --> 12:30.350
This one's also nice.

12:30.560 --> 12:31.310
Huh?

12:31.520 --> 12:33.690
But isn't this...?

12:35.690 --> 12:38.400
I hope Sis isn't in a bad mood.

12:38.820 --> 12:41.070
What's really bad is that you forgot to bring it with you.

12:41.780 --> 12:43.200
It sure is.

12:53.330 --> 12:54.250
I'm coming in.

12:58.210 --> 12:59.040
Umm...

12:59.710 --> 13:01.800
Koyori isn't here again?

13:01.800 --> 13:02.960
Where's Yorito?

13:12.770 --> 13:13.850
Hey.

13:14.020 --> 13:15.770
What are you doing?

13:16.020 --> 13:19.110
Sis is in a really bad mood today.

13:20.400 --> 13:23.150
I don't really see the difference though...

13:23.150 --> 13:24.950
Just come with me, will you?

13:24.950 --> 13:26.610
Hey, stop it...

13:33.660 --> 13:35.580
How are you feeling, Sis?

13:36.540 --> 13:38.380
Normal. I want to go home.

13:39.460 --> 13:41.420
You know it doesn't work that way, don't you?

13:41.840 --> 13:43.630
We need the doctor's permission.

13:43.840 --> 13:45.880
I don't need permission from anyone.

13:46.050 --> 13:48.840
Everyone is just worried about you.

13:48.840 --> 13:50.970
There's no need to worry.

13:51.600 --> 13:53.390
I just want to go home.

13:53.390 --> 13:57.390
But if you force yourself to go home, and end up collapsing...

13:57.730 --> 14:00.190
I don't mind collapsing as long as I don't die.

14:01.400 --> 14:02.190
Sis...

14:05.360 --> 14:06.110
Yes?

14:11.240 --> 14:11.830
Mana-sa-

14:14.580 --> 14:16.200
Come on in quickly.

14:23.380 --> 14:24.000
Yorito.

14:26.170 --> 14:26.840
What?

14:27.800 --> 14:28.970
I went too far.

14:30.970 --> 14:31.760
Yorito.

14:32.180 --> 14:33.220
What is it?

14:41.650 --> 14:42.810
Sorry!

14:42.810 --> 14:44.690
I forgot it at home.

14:45.070 --> 14:48.030
To make up for it, I'll bring you two tomorrow.

14:48.320 --> 14:49.070
That won't do.

14:49.070 --> 14:50.240
I'll make it three!

14:50.240 --> 14:51.110
Five.

14:52.780 --> 14:54.030
Got it...

14:54.950 --> 14:59.580
Anyways, if Yorito had a better taste in...

14:59.580 --> 15:01.830
You shouldn't say that.

15:02.000 --> 15:05.670
It's true that it looks like he doesn't have any taste at all,

15:05.670 --> 15:06.920
but there are many-

15:06.920 --> 15:07.800
Thirty-six.

15:08.010 --> 15:11.050
Yes, they are thirty-six memories.

15:12.220 --> 15:13.760
You have that many?

15:14.050 --> 15:16.100
It'll be forty-one tomorrow.

15:16.470 --> 15:18.390
If Yorito doesn't forget again.

15:18.390 --> 15:20.100
I know that, so...

15:20.350 --> 15:23.650
But you remember exactly how many there are.

15:23.940 --> 15:25.570
Do you have a favorite?

15:30.570 --> 15:31.320
This one.

15:32.240 --> 15:33.030
That one...

15:33.240 --> 15:34.450
That was the first one I brought.

15:45.880 --> 15:46.920
Umm...

15:48.000 --> 15:48.920
Aono-san.

15:49.340 --> 15:51.170
There's something I need to tell you.

15:54.340 --> 15:55.300
Well...

16:02.640 --> 16:05.020
Sorry! It's nothing!

16:05.150 --> 16:06.230
Koyori!

16:07.690 --> 16:08.780
Excuse me.

16:24.250 --> 16:25.000
Koyori?

17:07.290 --> 17:10.590
Koyori-chan promised that she'd tell her herself, right?

17:11.420 --> 17:11.960
Yeah.

17:13.050 --> 17:13.760
If that's the case...

17:14.840 --> 17:15.840
You're right.

17:17.010 --> 17:18.180
She should be fine,

17:18.470 --> 17:20.390
since she's my sister after all.

17:33.940 --> 17:35.240
Aono-san...

17:39.450 --> 17:40.120
Aono.

17:42.700 --> 17:43.950
Morimiya Aono.

17:45.000 --> 17:46.210
That's my name.

17:46.920 --> 17:49.290
Um... I already know that.

17:50.000 --> 17:51.920
You asked me my name before.

17:55.880 --> 17:57.470
Did the wrong one come out?

17:59.800 --> 18:02.970
No, nothing like that happened.

18:03.470 --> 18:04.850
I chose it myself.

18:05.480 --> 18:08.100
Even though I've never had coffee before.

18:09.150 --> 18:10.150
It's bitter.

18:11.110 --> 18:13.530
I tried some,

18:13.860 --> 18:15.940
but it wasn't that bitter.

18:16.280 --> 18:17.280
Would you like some?

18:17.450 --> 18:18.570
It'll warm you up.

18:18.950 --> 18:19.490
No thanks.

18:19.700 --> 18:21.530
Just imagine that you've been tricked into doing so.

18:32.500 --> 18:33.590
I've been tricked.

18:35.090 --> 18:37.220
I've been easily tricked by Koyori.

18:37.510 --> 18:41.680
Don't say it like that. It makes me look evil.

18:41.970 --> 18:42.470
But...

18:46.350 --> 18:47.230
It's warm.

18:50.230 --> 18:51.270
Back then...

18:52.060 --> 18:54.690
That time when I was wandering the halls, unable to sleep...

18:55.530 --> 18:59.780
When I saw you sitting with your origami,

19:00.530 --> 19:02.280
I thought you were a strange person.

19:03.580 --> 19:04.580
Normal.

19:05.200 --> 19:08.080
That's right. Sorry about that.

19:09.000 --> 19:11.790
Actually, what I wanted to tell you was "I want to learn how to fold origami".

19:15.840 --> 19:16.590
Hold this.

19:17.420 --> 19:18.090
Okay.

19:22.890 --> 19:24.510
The tip. Hold it.

19:25.140 --> 19:26.810
Um... I...

19:31.140 --> 19:32.400
Okay.

19:39.400 --> 19:40.200
Open your eyes.

19:44.820 --> 19:46.160
It's mysterious.

19:46.410 --> 19:47.910
Why does it change?

19:48.790 --> 19:50.410
Is it still a secret?

19:52.670 --> 19:55.840
I'll tell you exactly how to make it.

19:59.130 --> 20:00.340
Really?

20:02.010 --> 20:03.840
Yes, because we're friends.

20:13.810 --> 20:17.270
Um, can you teach me how to make others as well?

20:25.990 --> 20:26.830
Aono-san.

20:27.870 --> 20:29.330
I have something to tell you.

21:17.790 --> 21:18.840
I'll come visit you.

21:30.890 --> 21:32.220
Sorry about this, Yorito.

21:32.390 --> 21:33.600
Don't worry about it.

21:33.770 --> 21:35.520
I'll take her home for sure.

21:44.990 --> 21:45.990
What's the matter?

21:48.780 --> 21:49.490
Nothing.

22:13.350 --> 22:22.020
iro aseta page no kioku hitomi tojireba yomigaeru

22:13.350 --> 22:22.020
Memories on a faded page, they revive when I close my eyes

22:22.440 --> 22:31.200
adokenai shoujo no inori
habatakeyo kibou no sora he

22:22.440 --> 22:31.200
Prayers of an innocent girl
Fly away to the sky of hope

22:31.320 --> 22:35.620
nageku mamonaku  toki wa nagareru

22:31.320 --> 22:35.620
With no time to regret, time will flow

22:35.910 --> 22:40.710
hitori tachidomaru kedo

22:35.910 --> 22:40.710
Even though I stand alone

22:41.960 --> 22:47.470
yume mamoru shirabe  kuchizu samuno

22:41.960 --> 22:47.470
A tune to protect your dreams, I sing to myself

22:47.630 --> 22:51.970
hitobito ga nemuri ni tsukeba

22:47.630 --> 22:51.970
When people go into slumber

22:52.180 --> 22:59.890
mata au hi no negai tsumugeru deshou  ai no ito

22:52.180 --> 22:59.890
Their wish to unite can be woven. The thread of love

23:00.190 --> 23:10.320
yasashisa wo sasou  otogibanashi anata kara osowatta no yo

23:00.190 --> 23:10.320
Fairy tales that elicit kindness I learned that from you

23:10.490 --> 23:20.250
modorimashou  sotto ano koro no omoi ni

23:10.490 --> 23:20.250
Let us return gently to the memories of those times

23:30.010 --> 23:45.100
Next Time

23:30.010 --> 23:45.110
Pouring Light

23:30.880 --> 23:34.300
Do you prefer the nori in your onigiri crisp or moist?

23:34.300 --> 23:35.140
Uh, crisp?

23:35.140 --> 23:38.520
Do you prefer obentou warmed at the store or at home?

23:38.520 --> 23:40.180
Uh, at home?

23:40.180 --> 23:42.400
No wonder your lazy beard is so thick.

23:42.400 --> 23:44.360
Is that the reason why?
